{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-10_end","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-10","title":"灯火将熄","storyCode":"4-10","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-10_end.txt","sourceHash":"e906b0d758de2ef28d2a78d12fef6c5f37218f9152eeb02a70ebd6ed680fc5d8","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"霜叶的努力为阿米娅争取到了一个破局的机会，众人终于得以撤退。\n然而等待她们的，却是龙门危险的消息......","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_6"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陨星！我们击退了雪怪小队！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"确实，我有点低估你们罗德岛了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"下手是不是，还是太轻了些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（手指已经没有知觉了......可恶......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么回事.....？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"寒流......还在凝聚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"这一次......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"你们就不会那么好运了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不好.......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"她是想吸收整片区域内的寒气，一口气爆发出来吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"——♩——♬——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——那种法术，会抽干我们所有人的热量！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这种规模，比起她刚才所使用的法术，庞大太多了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"就这样结束吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"就让纯粹无瑕的冰霜，埋葬你们的愤怒吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......♩......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么，阻止了寒冷继续汇集......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"......咕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"是你做的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是说过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"不允许你......再前进了吗......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"——拼尽全力用自己的法术，停滞了寒潮的聚流吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是个好孩子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"霜叶用冰刃，分割了气流吗......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，但是她......支撑不了多久！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"冰刃已经......快要碎裂了！"},{"type":"d