好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"大家！快撤退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陨星，带霜叶先走，我掩护你们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"......咕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈......咳哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"霜叶......撑下去......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"别死......可别死了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"别担心......我的命......还挺硬的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是......阿米娅也是！怎么一个两个都是这样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"再怎么逞强......你们也只是孩子而已啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"还把我当孩子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"......那我要是死了，救了你们几个，不还蛮值的吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"你——你给我记住了！下次你再这么做......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"再这么做......我就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......对不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"跑起来吧，陨星。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"别......回头......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"走！快走！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"撤出当前区域！优先保护伤员和医疗干员！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"狙击小队......！瞄准整合运动符号，射击！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"破坏它的结构！解体整栋大楼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"爆炸引起的雾气更浓了——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"趁现在！动作快！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"全员撤出广场区域！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"逃掉了——吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"————"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你看了多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"几分钟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这些战士值得称赞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_40_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的身体状况不理想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——用不着你来提醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName